Hello,

My family and I are really looking forward to our stay in your resort. I
was wondering if you could help me something. We were thinking of going to
Koh Surin for one or two nights after our stay with you. I was hoping there
is a tour operator that departs from Koh Phayam. Maybe even one way would
be fine and then we would return to a different port. Or both ways from Koh
Phayam. Do you know a boat trip operator with whom we could book this?

Thank you very much for your help.

Kind regards,
Patricia

